 "summary": "A family of 50 single silicon Zener diodes in the SOD-123 surface-mount package, rated 1000 mW, with nominal Zener voltages from 3.3 V to 330 V. Each type is marked with a three-letter code. Uses: a reference voltage for a regulated supply, or overvoltage protection. MM1W3V6 is the 3.6 V type: 3.40 V to 3.80 V at 69 mA, code FHE.",
